":{"zh":"小行星保险库","en":"Asteroid Vault"},"texts":[{"zh":"打开保险库所带来的问题比它解决的要多得多。放置在里面的是各种各样稀奇古怪的东西，从垃圾到可能来自被遗忘帝国的文物。整理这些物品需要一些时间，但我们确实找到了一些有用的东西。","en":"Opening the vault has raised more questions than it has answered. Contained within is an esoteric collection of items ranging from junk to what are possibly artifacts from a forgotten empire. Sorting through it all took some time, but we did find some useful items."}],"sections":[],"image":"art/93b3620d437a373e317d.webp","hidden":false,"choices":[{"key":"ancrel.103.a","label":{"zh":"一个惊喜！","en":"A welcome surprise!"},"responses":[],"tooltips":[],"conditional":false,"next":[],"terminal":false}],"next":[],"source":{"file":"events/ancient_relics_arcsite_events_1.txt","line":698}}]}